Dear Racheal,


Thank you again for sharing the FairBanks Partnership Brief. We see a stron=
g thematic and geographic fit with Synergya, particularly around healthcare=
 innovation and the Uganda/East Africa ecosystem.


At this stage, I think the most appropriate way for us to work together is =
through our Ecosystem Partner model, rather than positioning FairBanks as a=
 Synergya venture. As a first step to that, we would be very happy to onboa=
rd FairBanks as an Ecosystem Partner now, particularly if you can help us i=
dentify and refer relevant Ugandan health and sustainability startups and s=
caleups that could benefit from Synergya's zero-fee, zero-equity scaling mo=
del. Once we have received the above information and started seeing some re=
levant Ugandan startups referred through FairBanks, I suggest we find time =
to meet end of October to review the first opportunities and discuss the fo=
rmalisation of our agreement.


For referred ventures, please ask them to apply through https://synergya.io=
/apply and use referral code 67E06CE1, which is valid through the end of se=
pt 2026. We would also be pleased for you to share this short video with re=
levant founders to help them understand what Synergya does:

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DsnNAGIvMA0c


Looking further ahead, we expect our next marketplace release in approximat=
ely 6 months to open the Partner Circle to a broader range of providers and=
 implementation partners. Given FairBanks' operating healthcare environment=
 in Kampala, community-facing capacity and potential to support pilots and =
local implementation, there may be a particularly interesting role for you =
there. When we reach that stage, we would be happy to explore FairBanks bec=
oming an official Synergya Marketplace Provider, with a defined set of serv=
ices, facilities or implementation capabilities made available to Synergya =
members under preferential conditions.


For now, it would be very helpful if you could start identifying the specif=
ic services, facilities or capabilities FairBanks could make available to S=
ynergya members, together with your preferential pricing or conditions. As =
a general principle, marketplace offers should be either fully free or at l=
east 20% below market value for Synergya members, and Synergya charges 15% =
on completed sales. There is no listing fee.


We are also currently a finalist for the Swiss Future Award 2026 and would =
greatly appreciate FairBanks' support with a vote:
https://www.linkedin.com/posts/synergyaintl_were-in-theswiss-future-awardfi=
nals-activity-7500942633754787840-O5R4


We look forward to seeing what we can build together.


Warm regards,
Lucy Setian
